{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/vikktorrrre/status/2110821312318865692","id":"2110821312318865692","text":"Sam Altman: We’ve all been too ambitious on AI timelines, even with this incredible technology.\n\n“I thought when we got to GPT-4, there was going to be much more disruption in software right away.”\n\n“I was wrong about the speed.”\n\n“The economy just has so much inertia. People keep doing the same things and buying from the same companies.”\n\n“AI is one of the most incredible technologies humanity has ever invented, but society and the economy will adapt more slowly.”\n\n“Changing behavior is just much harder than tech nerds realize.”","raw_text":{"text":"Sam Altman: We’ve all been too ambitious on AI timelines, even with this incredible technology.\n\n“I thought when we got to GPT-4, there was going to be much more disruption in software right away.”\n\n“I was wrong about the speed.”\n\n“The economy just has so much inertia. People keep doing the same things and buying from the same companies.”\n\n“AI is one of the most incredible technologies humanity has ever invented, but society and the economy will adapt more slowly.”\n\n“Changing behavior is just much harder than tech nerds realize.”","display_text_range":[0,535],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[277,300],"id":"2110819461099843584","display":"pic.x.com/RTBsQ38Fe6","original":"https://t.co/RTBsQ38Fe6","replacement":"https://x.com/vikktorrrre/status/2110821312318865692/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"vikktorrrre","url":"https://x.com/vikktorrrre","id":"1785805702935515137","followers":11279,"following":1875,"likes":175460,"media_count":17079,"name":"Veee","description":"AI/TECH","raw_description":{"text":"AI/TECH","facets":[]},"location":"AGI","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1785805702935515137/1768702625","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012714142877044736/_6qWAbnU_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed May 01 22:57:37 +0000 2024","protected